{"id":"std/math/log_int","kind":"std","title":"std.math.log_int","sourcePath":"std/math/log_int.zig","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/std/#std.math.log_int","file":"std/math/log_int.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"std.math.log_int","text":"std.math.log_int"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.math.log_int.assert","text":"std.math.log_int.assert"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.math.log_int.log_int","text":"std.math.log_int.log_int"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.math.log_int.Log2Int","text":"std.math.log_int.Log2Int"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.math.log_int.math","text":"std.math.log_int.math"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.math.log_int.std","text":"std.math.log_int.std"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.math.log_int.testing","text":"std.math.log_int.testing"},{"depth":2,"slug":"source","text":"Source code"}],"symbols":[{"id":"std/math/log_int.zig:1:2287","name":"std.math.log_int","anchor":"std.math.log_int","category":"namespace","sourceLine":1},{"id":"std/math/log_int.zig:4:2291","name":"std.math.log_int.assert","anchor":"std.math.log_int.assert","category":"alias","sourceLine":4},{"id":"std/math/log_int.zig:9:2293","name":"std.math.log_int.log_int","anchor":"std.math.log_int.log_int","category":"function","sourceLine":9},{"id":"std/math/log_int.zig:5:2292","name":"std.math.log_int.Log2Int","anchor":"std.math.log_int.Log2Int","category":"alias","sourceLine":5},{"id":"std/math/log_int.zig:2:2289","name":"std.math.log_int.math","anchor":"std.math.log_int.math","category":"alias","sourceLine":2},{"id":"std/math/log_int.zig:1:2288","name":"std.math.log_int.std","anchor":"std.math.log_int.std","category":"alias","sourceLine":1},{"id":"std/math/log_int.zig:3:2290","name":"std.math.log_int.testing","anchor":"std.math.log_int.testing","category":"alias","sourceLine":3}],"html":"<div id=\"std.math.log_int\"></div>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">Source line 1</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/#std.math\"><code>math</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing\"><code>testing</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/debug/#std.debug.assert\"><code>assert</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/#std.math.Log2Int\"><code>Log2Int</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/log_int/#std.math.log_int.log_int\"><code>log_int</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.log_int.assert\"><h3><code>std.math.log_int.assert</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L4\">Source line 4</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/debug/#std.debug.assert\"><code>std.debug.assert</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.log_int.log_int\"><h3><code>std.math.log_int.log_int</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">function</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L9\">Source line 9</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>Returns the logarithm of <code>x</code> for the provided <code>base</code>, rounding down to the nearest integer.\nAsserts that <code>base &gt; 1</code> and <code>x &gt; 0</code>.</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">log_int</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>, base: T, x: T) <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/#std.math.Log2Int\">Log2Int</a>(T)</code></pre>\n<h4>Parameters</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>base: T</code></pre>\n<pre><code>x: T</code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.log_int.Log2Int\"><h3><code>std.math.log_int.Log2Int</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L5\">Source line 5</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/#std.math.Log2Int\"><code>std.math.Log2Int</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.log_int.math\"><h3><code>std.math.log_int.math</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L2\">Source line 2</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/#std.math\"><code>std.math</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.log_int.std\"><h3><code>std.math.log_int.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">Source line 1</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.log_int.testing\"><h3><code>std.math.log_int.testing</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L3\">Source line 3</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing\"><code>std.testing</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<details class=\"source-code\" id=\"source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><summary>Source code</summary><p><code>std/math/log_int.zig</code></p><div class=\"source-grid\"><pre class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-copy-ignore=\"\"><code><a id=\"L1\" href=\"#L1\" tabindex=\"-1\">1</a>\n<a id=\"L2\" href=\"#L2\" tabindex=\"-1\">2</a>\n<a id=\"L3\" href=\"#L3\" tabindex=\"-1\">3</a>\n<a id=\"L4\" href=\"#L4\" tabindex=\"-1\">4</a>\n<a id=\"L5\" href=\"#L5\" tabindex=\"-1\">5</a>\n<a id=\"L6\" href=\"#L6\" tabindex=\"-1\">6</a>\n<a id=\"L7\" href=\"#L7\" tabindex=\"-1\">7</a>\n<a id=\"L8\" href=\"#L8\" tabindex=\"-1\">8</a>\n<a id=\"L9\" href=\"#L9\" tabindex=\"-1\">9</a>\n<a id=\"L10\" href=\"#L10\" tabindex=\"-1\">10</a>\n<a id=\"L11\" href=\"#L11\" tabindex=\"-1\">11</a>\n<a id=\"L12\" href=\"#L12\" tabindex=\"-1\">12</a>\n<a id=\"L13\" href=\"#L13\" tabindex=\"-1\">13</a>\n<a id=\"L14\"